# Relay continuity

When continuing unfinished work in this repository:

1. Run `python3 -m relay status` and, if a task is known, `python3 -m relay resume --task <id>`.
2. Read `plans/handoffs/<task-id>/HANDOFF.md` and `checkpoint.json` if present.
3. Verify Git status against the recorded branch/HEAD before editing.
4. Do not invent test results or claim prior context was fully transferred.
5. Update the checkpoint after meaningful progress: `python3 -m relay handoff --task <id>`.
